OL,3,GNEWSAUnearthing the Isle of Man's      
OL,4,Aancient past                           
OL,6,FA dedicated group of metal detectorists
OL,7,Fare helping to build a clearer picture 
OL,8,Fof the Isle of Man's ancient past,     
OL,9,Funearthing a variety of items dating   
OL,10,Fback thousands of years.               
OL,12,FEnthusiastic amateurs often get        
OL,13,Fpermission from farmers to explore the 
OL,14,Fisland's abundance of fields.          
OL,16,FTagging along on one such excursion,   
OL,17,Fitems discovered in less than an hour  
OL,18,Fincluded a George III bull head silver 
OL,19,Fcoin, a dandy button, and a silver shoe
OL,20,Fbuckle.                                
