OL,3,GNEWSAUnearthing the Isle of Man's      
OL,4,Aancient past                           
OL,6,FBut on other occassions, far loftier   
OL,7,Fhoards have been discovered within Manx
OL,8,Fsoil. Daniel Crowe recently had a      
OL,9,Fcollection of item, including a Viking 
OL,10,Fsword and brooches, declared treasure. 
